; ===========================================================================
; myrkrshell.def - the exports of the drag-drop shell extension.
;
; Exactly two, and deliberately so.  COM needs DllGetClassObject to hand out
; the class factory and DllCanUnloadNow to ask whether the module may go; every
; other entry point would be surface for no gain.
;
; There is no DllRegisterServer.  Registration is written by the MSI (see
; tools\make_msi.ps1), because a self-registering DLL cannot be rolled back
; cleanly by Windows Installer and leaves a half-registered CLSID behind when
; an install fails.
;
; x64 has no name decoration, so the names below are what the loader sees.
; PRIVATE keeps them out of the import library - nothing links against this DLL.
; ===========================================================================
LIBRARY myrkrshell
EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject   PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow     PRIVATE
